      "canonicalConceptId": "concept:3b245dd6feca8251e90824479bdf5ab246908953d37241b10113f2f7cb48d6dd",
      "text": "CBT evidence for care-partner burden is mixed: the preliminary Secker\u2013Brown trial reported improvement, whereas a 2024 meta-analysis reported no significant pooled burden reduction. The positive small trial does not establish a reliable general effect, and the pooled null result does not prove that no individual can benefit.",
      "sources": [
        "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC1739584/",
        "https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38573387/"
      ],
      "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
