      "documentConcept": "Care partner support and caregiver burden in PD",
      "canonicalConceptId": "concept:3b245dd6feca8251e90824479bdf5ab246908953d37241b10113f2f7cb48d6dd",
      "text": "Evidence on cognition requires qualification: the scoping review described cognitive impairment as a consistent burden predictor, while the 2025 review restricted to multivariable analyses found general cognitive function did not predict burden. These differently scoped findings should remain attributed rather than collapsed into a universal cognitive-score rule.",
